
# Server route in the route DSL. A small users API: list and create.
# The matcher and handler binding are ours; HTTP transport delegates to native per backend.

hook /users
  task get
    take query
      like hash
    call list-users
      bind page, read page

  task post
    take body
      like hash
    call make-user
      bind name, read name
    send json
      read user
